Before asking:

"Should I buy?"

ask:

"What kind of market am I in?"

Example:

                    MARKET
                       │
          ┌────────────┼────────────┐
          ↓            ↓            ↓
        TREND         RANGE       VOLATILE
          │            │            │
      ┌───┴───┐      ┌─┴─┐      ┌──┴──┐
      ↓       ↓      ↓   ↓      ↓     ↓
     Bull    Bear   Tight Wide  Event Normal

Then strategies become regime-specific.

For example:

TRENDING
 → trend-following strategies

RANGING
 → mean-reversion strategies

BREAKOUT
 → breakout/retest strategies

HIGH VOLATILITY
 → reduce position size / different strategy

NEWS EVENT
 → possibly NO TRADE

This can dramatically improve the architecture compared with blindly running every strategy all the time.
